@startuml
title AI cancel | reference and planned boundaries
hide footbox
participant "Monitoring" as P0
participant "H10 planned" as P1
participant "H09" as P2
participant "H11 planned" as P3
P0 -> P1: Urgent prompt or privacy withdrawal
P1 -> P2: cancel()
P2 -> P3: Provider.cancel(ID) if Waiting
P1 -> P3: Stop recording and playback; clear buffers
P3 -> P2: Late result rejected
P1 -> P0: Continue deterministic monitoring
note over P0: Scenarios include alternatives; read the v2.0 sequence guide for guards.
@enduml
